WEBVTT

00:31.630 --> 00:35.180
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.200 --> 00:38.580
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.850 --> 00:44.820
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.980 --> 00:49.610
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.630 --> 00:53.140
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:53.160 --> 00:56.650
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.670 --> 01:00.180
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.200 --> 01:06.260
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.520 --> 01:23.800
Si Jin

01:23.820 --> 01:27.800
Episode 37

01:27.800 --> 01:29.800
(Prince Yan's Mansion)

01:34.930 --> 01:35.910
Marquis,

01:35.930 --> 01:37.490
here's a secret letter..

01:41.210 --> 01:42.110
Mr. Zhen,

01:42.130 --> 01:43.360
a list of Nanwu's spies

01:43.360 --> 01:44.300
has been found

01:44.300 --> 01:46.380
in Prince Yan's Mansion.

01:46.380 --> 01:48.330
No way! It's a set-up!

01:48.330 --> 01:49.800
Here's the evidence.

01:49.820 --> 01:52.420
See for yourself, Mr. Zhen.

01:56.900 --> 01:58.300
Who found this letter?

01:58.300 --> 01:59.190
I did.

01:59.210 --> 02:00.700
Answer my question.

02:01.050 --> 02:03.900
Where exactly did you find this letter?

02:03.920 --> 02:05.230
Under the pillow in the bedroom.

02:05.250 --> 02:07.230
Such a confidential list

02:07.250 --> 02:09.160
was placed under a pillow?

02:09.180 --> 02:10.790
Don't you think that's suspicious?

02:10.810 --> 02:12.820
Whether it's suspicious or not

02:13.860 --> 02:16.540
is not for you to decide, Mr. Zhen.

02:18.090 --> 02:20.850
Let's go to Earl Dongping's Mansion.

02:25.470 --> 02:26.610
Mr. Zhen, what should we do?

02:26.610 --> 02:28.350
They are going
to Earl Dongping's Mansion.

02:28.370 --> 02:29.790
The people there are

02:29.810 --> 02:31.680
the Princess Consort's maternal family.

02:31.700 --> 02:33.100
According to the law,

02:33.250 --> 02:35.560
they should be detained
and put on trial.

02:35.580 --> 02:37.170
There is nothing I can do.

02:37.370 --> 02:38.730
But don't worry.

02:39.090 --> 02:40.600
At this stage,

02:40.620 --> 02:42.700
Marquis Changxing won't act recklessly.

02:43.370 --> 02:44.730
Let's go.

03:16.020 --> 03:17.380
Mother,

03:17.770 --> 03:19.850
I am getting married today.

03:20.700 --> 03:22.460
In the future,

03:22.460 --> 03:24.540
I won't be able to serve you.

03:25.050 --> 03:28.450
I hope you'll be safe and healthy.

04:33.600 --> 04:41.120
(Qingyun Paper Workshop)

04:49.690 --> 04:51.050
Shopkeeper.

04:51.620 --> 04:53.300
Sir, what would you like?

04:54.300 --> 04:55.760
Please take a look at this.

04:55.780 --> 04:58.620
Does this paper
have any special properties?

05:01.930 --> 05:03.790
Just as you said,

05:03.810 --> 05:05.860
this paper is quite extraordinary.

05:05.980 --> 05:08.080
It's smooth as spring ice,
dense as snow,

05:08.100 --> 05:11.140
firm and pure as jade,
fine and light as silk.

05:11.490 --> 05:13.300
If I'm not mistaken,

05:13.540 --> 05:16.260
this is Chengxintang Paper.

05:16.300 --> 05:17.910
The quality of this paper

05:17.930 --> 05:19.640
surpasses all others.

05:19.660 --> 05:22.410
No ordinary can get hold of it,

05:22.540 --> 05:23.900
no matter the cost.

05:24.370 --> 05:26.530
Chengxintang Paper...

05:31.760 --> 05:34.760
(Earl Dongping's Mansion)

05:34.760 --> 05:36.640
(Jiang)

05:37.250 --> 05:38.790
Jiang Si from Earl Dongping's family

05:38.810 --> 05:40.200
is Nanwu's Saintess,

05:40.220 --> 05:41.960
and is suspected of treason.

05:41.980 --> 05:45.410
I've come to confiscate by order.

05:46.660 --> 05:48.020
Come out!

05:50.570 --> 05:52.400
- Move!
- Move!

05:52.420 --> 05:53.360
- Hurry!
- Hurry!

05:53.380 --> 05:54.220
Move! Hurry!

05:54.220 --> 05:55.820
- Move!
- Hurry!

05:56.690 --> 05:58.650
Yan, come with me.

05:58.860 --> 06:00.220
Hide.

06:00.420 --> 06:02.330
- Hurry!
- Be quiet!

06:03.370 --> 06:04.730
Hurry!

06:07.660 --> 06:08.670
- Ancheng.
- Go!

06:08.690 --> 06:10.840
- Look at your daughter.
- Go!

06:10.860 --> 06:12.230
Instead of bringing blessings,

06:12.250 --> 06:14.140
she has brought disaster upon us.

06:17.180 --> 06:18.700
Marquis,

06:19.780 --> 06:22.260
we were once in-laws.

06:22.540 --> 06:24.180
Please have mercy.

06:27.930 --> 06:29.290
In-laws?

06:30.370 --> 06:32.760
When my son was beheaded,

06:32.780 --> 06:34.620
why didn't I hear you

06:34.780 --> 06:36.620
call me an in-law then?

06:37.540 --> 06:39.200
That was because he committed crimes,

06:39.220 --> 06:41.080
harming so many women.

06:41.100 --> 06:42.340
He brought it upon himself.

06:42.340 --> 06:43.470
Shut up!

06:43.490 --> 06:44.690
Now, your daughter Jiang Si

06:44.690 --> 06:45.720
has committed treason.

06:45.740 --> 06:46.910
No one in your family

06:46.930 --> 06:48.080
can escape responsibility.

06:48.100 --> 06:49.980
My daughter could never

06:49.980 --> 06:51.430
collude with the enemy.

06:51.450 --> 06:54.550
Someone must have framed her.

06:54.570 --> 06:55.910
Are you questioning

06:55.930 --> 06:57.960
His Majesty's judgment?

06:57.980 --> 06:59.930
Shall I relay your exact words

06:59.930 --> 07:02.330
to His Majesty?

07:07.300 --> 07:08.660
By the way,

07:09.420 --> 07:11.410
my dear former in-law,

07:11.540 --> 07:14.640
don't worry.

07:14.660 --> 07:17.410
I won't let go

07:17.740 --> 07:20.450
of my former daughter-in-law

07:20.450 --> 07:22.820
and your son who's outside.

07:25.860 --> 07:27.550
You're avenging on us!

07:27.570 --> 07:28.540
So what?

07:28.540 --> 07:29.420
Jiang Si is

07:29.430 --> 07:30.980
from your family after all.

07:31.000 --> 07:31.860
Arrest them all.

07:31.860 --> 07:33.030
Yes.

07:33.050 --> 07:34.410
Wait.

07:40.370 --> 07:41.890
Jiang Si has long severed ties

07:41.890 --> 07:43.330
with our family.

07:43.660 --> 07:45.660
This is the Letter of Disownment
between us.

07:45.660 --> 07:46.890
A Letter of Disownment?

07:46.890 --> 07:47.780
It's worthless.

07:47.780 --> 07:49.230
Ancheng, what's going on?

07:49.250 --> 07:50.280
Marquis,

07:50.300 --> 07:52.110
this is not just a piece of paper.

07:52.130 --> 07:54.430
It was stamped by our family seal

07:54.450 --> 07:57.020
(Severed all ties; Jiang Si)
and Capital Security.

07:58.450 --> 08:00.160
Do you think

08:00.180 --> 08:03.090
this can absolve you?

08:04.490 --> 08:07.010
Don't think about it.

08:07.620 --> 08:09.990
Marquis, tearing it
won't change anything.

08:10.010 --> 08:12.430
This document has been filed
in Capital Security.

08:12.450 --> 08:14.160
According to the law,

08:14.180 --> 08:15.520
with this document,

08:15.540 --> 08:16.620
whether Jiang Si is guilty

08:16.620 --> 08:17.720
or holds power

08:17.740 --> 08:18.890
has nothing to do

08:18.890 --> 08:20.320
with us.

08:20.340 --> 08:21.700
Marquis,

08:21.890 --> 08:24.100
please release my innocent family.

08:24.700 --> 08:26.350
If you have any objections,

08:26.370 --> 08:28.580
we can go to His Majesty.

08:28.860 --> 08:30.580
I'm surprised

08:31.060 --> 08:33.770
that Jiang Si left this backup plan.

08:34.940 --> 08:36.920
But I don't believe

08:36.940 --> 08:38.010
your family

08:38.010 --> 08:39.800
can escape unscathed.

08:39.820 --> 08:40.750
Listen up.

08:40.770 --> 08:42.680
This mansion is to be strictly guarded.

08:42.700 --> 08:44.410
No one is allowed in or out

08:44.770 --> 08:48.320
to prevent any communication
with Nanwu.

08:48.340 --> 08:49.700
Yes.

08:57.700 --> 08:59.650
Grandmother, are you okay?

09:15.440 --> 09:18.960
(With all ties severed,
I'm not a Jiang anymore.)

09:22.620 --> 09:24.650
Did Si give you this?

09:25.220 --> 09:26.580
Yes.

09:27.640 --> 09:28.700
(Letter of Disownment)

09:28.700 --> 09:29.680
Yi,

09:29.700 --> 09:31.460
please bring this back.

09:31.530 --> 09:33.260
In a critical moment,

09:33.460 --> 09:35.460
it will save everyone from disaster.

09:37.370 --> 09:39.340
This must be your hidden motive.

09:42.220 --> 09:43.620
Don't worry, Si.

09:43.890 --> 09:45.750
I'll take care of things at home.

09:46.820 --> 09:48.290
So,

09:49.100 --> 09:52.260
that day,

09:52.460 --> 09:54.580
Si cut ties with us

09:55.770 --> 09:58.860
to protect us

09:58.980 --> 10:02.740
from ruin.

10:04.840 --> 10:08.220
(Severed all ties; Jiang Si)

10:08.220 --> 10:13.800
♪ Life is like flowers,
blooming and fading with the seasons ♪

10:14.680 --> 10:19.940
♪ Wind leaves marks,
swaying in the breeze ♪

10:20.510 --> 10:23.600
♪ I don't wish for favors
from the heavens ♪

10:23.620 --> 10:26.620
♪ To enjoy a blessed life ♪

10:26.810 --> 10:31.210
♪ I only wish to be unburdened ♪

10:31.220 --> 10:32.580
Time to eat.

10:32.820 --> 10:34.180
Have the congee.

10:34.490 --> 10:35.460
She's the Nanwu witch.

10:35.460 --> 10:36.390
A traitor.

10:36.410 --> 10:38.110
The Grand Princess ordered

10:38.130 --> 10:40.170
half a bun for three days

10:40.220 --> 10:41.580
for her to survive.

10:44.170 --> 10:45.570
She was once the Princess Consort.

10:45.590 --> 10:46.540
Get lost.

10:46.540 --> 10:49.140
♪ As the sun sets,
the wise seek redemption ♪

10:49.140 --> 10:52.810
♪ I only wish to wake up one day ♪

10:53.740 --> 10:55.100
I was wrong

10:55.890 --> 10:58.790
about Si.

10:58.810 --> 11:01.770
♪ Alas, is it too late ♪

11:02.740 --> 11:05.010
I owe Si an apology.

11:05.140 --> 11:07.470
♪ Is it too difficult ♪

11:07.490 --> 11:09.460
I wonder

11:10.710 --> 11:12.040
how Si is now.

11:12.040 --> 11:14.810
♪ How many regrets are left ♪

11:14.810 --> 11:18.520
♪ To be remedied ♪

11:18.540 --> 11:24.360
♪ A small greed forms an unbreakable tie ♪

11:24.380 --> 11:30.610
♪ Is the resting shore too shallow ♪

11:30.630 --> 11:37.070
♪ Is the yearning
in my heart too distant ♪

11:37.090 --> 11:40.390
♪ The wildflowers bloom
across the mountains ♪

11:40.410 --> 11:44.040
♪ Yet I remain trapped ♪

11:44.060 --> 11:50.840
♪ A shared bond, a tragic ending ♪

11:51.120 --> 11:54.230
(Peace and Prosperity)

11:54.250 --> 11:55.870
There's no such thing as Nanwu's spells.

11:55.890 --> 11:56.860
Si got

11:56.860 --> 11:58.040
the prescription

11:58.060 --> 11:59.490
for my eyes

11:59.490 --> 12:00.600
from an old folk book.

12:00.620 --> 12:02.720
She got the herbs
from the Imperial Pharmacy.

12:02.740 --> 12:04.230
Your Highness,

12:04.250 --> 12:06.270
don't be fooled by this witch.

12:06.290 --> 12:07.580
If there are no spells of Nanwu,

12:07.580 --> 12:09.020
then why have the imperial physicians

12:09.040 --> 12:10.020
and the famous physicians

12:10.040 --> 12:11.040
failed to treat it

12:11.060 --> 12:12.270
after so many years

12:12.290 --> 12:14.470
while she alone found the cure?

12:14.490 --> 12:16.090
Marquis Changxing, don't you understand

12:16.110 --> 12:17.440
what coincidence means?

12:17.460 --> 12:19.010
Or do you and your officers

12:19.010 --> 12:20.460
just guess at cases?

12:20.890 --> 12:22.250
Fuqing.

12:22.920 --> 12:24.010
(Sunshine and Luxury)

12:24.010 --> 12:26.440
Today, both chief judges are here.

12:26.460 --> 12:28.010
I want to speak

12:28.010 --> 12:29.690
on behalf of Princess Yan.

12:29.860 --> 12:32.630
She's warm-hearted,

12:32.650 --> 12:34.290
kind, and clear-minded.

12:34.490 --> 12:37.460
You cannot condemn her
because of her identity.

12:37.770 --> 12:39.410
Without evidence,

12:40.580 --> 12:42.470
it may be hard to convince the public.

12:42.490 --> 12:44.150
Rest assured, Your Highness.

12:44.220 --> 12:46.350
I will get to the bottom of this.

12:46.370 --> 12:47.770
Good.

12:48.290 --> 12:51.150
Well said, Mr. Zhen.

12:51.170 --> 12:53.270
Rest assured, Your Highness.

12:53.290 --> 12:54.800
We've found the evidence.

12:54.820 --> 12:58.110
We will not let any wrongdoer
go unpunished.

12:58.130 --> 12:59.150
What evidence?

12:59.170 --> 13:00.320
A solid one.

13:00.340 --> 13:02.920
I'll present it to His Majesty shortly.

13:02.940 --> 13:05.380
You'll know soon enough, Your Highness.

13:05.860 --> 13:07.260
Right, Mr. Zhen?

13:16.530 --> 13:18.720
Sorry for disturbing you today.

13:18.740 --> 13:20.080
As things have been clarified,

13:20.100 --> 13:22.380
I'll take my leave now.

13:23.220 --> 13:24.890
I take my leave.

13:27.860 --> 13:29.460
Mr. Zhen, please stay.

13:37.010 --> 13:38.200
Mr. Zhen,

13:38.220 --> 13:40.980
I have something to discuss with you.

13:54.010 --> 13:55.370
Consort Xian.

13:55.580 --> 13:56.940
Consort Xian.

13:57.980 --> 13:59.340
It's your turn.

14:09.460 --> 14:10.470
Your Majesty.

14:10.490 --> 14:12.100
What is this about?

14:13.700 --> 14:16.690
If you're pleading for Jin and his wife,

14:18.170 --> 14:19.010
save it.

14:19.010 --> 14:20.990
I'm not pleading for them.

14:21.010 --> 14:23.380
I'm suing the Grand Princess.

14:24.770 --> 14:26.130
Why?

14:26.370 --> 14:29.320
Rongyang incriminated your son
and daughter-in-law,

14:29.340 --> 14:30.720
so you want to accuse her?

14:30.740 --> 14:33.150
You've learned to frame others now?

14:33.170 --> 14:35.250
It was the Grand Princess who altered

14:35.250 --> 14:37.270
the celestial signs when Jin was born,

14:37.290 --> 14:39.350
slandering him as an unlucky man.

14:39.370 --> 14:40.210
Who told you this?

14:40.220 --> 14:41.170
What proof do you have?

14:41.170 --> 14:43.320
I have no proof of this,

14:43.340 --> 14:45.560
but the Grand Princess has committed

14:45.580 --> 14:47.260
many other wrongdoings.

14:47.860 --> 14:49.220
Actually,

14:49.580 --> 14:51.650
Mother and I wanted to save Jin and Si,

14:52.100 --> 14:54.390
so what we told Marquis Changxing

14:54.410 --> 14:55.630
was a lie.

14:55.650 --> 14:57.170
Is there a hidden truth?

14:57.460 --> 14:59.290
Listen.

14:59.980 --> 15:02.860
Si does know Nanwu's secret spells,

15:02.890 --> 15:04.230
and my blindness is

15:04.250 --> 15:05.770
indeed caused

15:05.770 --> 15:07.040
by the Nanwu worm.

15:07.060 --> 15:08.420
Moreover,

15:08.530 --> 15:10.290
it was the Grand Princess

15:11.370 --> 15:12.920
who ordered to blind me.

15:12.940 --> 15:14.630
This is the confession of Ms. Xu,

15:14.650 --> 15:16.470
Grand Princess's wet nurse.

15:16.490 --> 15:18.320
Your Majesty, please believe me.

15:22.890 --> 15:23.740
Do you really believe

15:23.740 --> 15:25.990
that Si would commit treason?

15:26.010 --> 15:26.870
In my opinion,

15:26.890 --> 15:28.350
it's the Grand Princess who's afraid

15:28.370 --> 15:29.900
that her dealings with the Nanwu woman

15:29.900 --> 15:31.610
and the harm she caused will be exposed,

15:31.610 --> 15:33.270
so she's accusing others first.

15:33.290 --> 15:35.460
So what if Jiang Si bears

15:35.460 --> 15:36.600
that totem?

15:36.620 --> 15:38.320
She is from Dazhou!

15:38.340 --> 15:40.630
She married our Prince!

15:40.650 --> 15:41.840
Is she insane?

15:41.860 --> 15:42.700
Why would she work

15:42.700 --> 15:44.810
for the Nanwu she's never even been to?

15:44.940 --> 15:46.770
Your Majesty, you must understand

15:47.250 --> 15:49.500
such a simple logic, right?

15:49.860 --> 15:52.140
I've handled many cases.

15:52.170 --> 15:54.080
Every crime has a motive.

15:54.100 --> 15:56.220
But I truly can't understand

15:56.700 --> 15:58.290
why the Grand Princess would harm you.

15:58.290 --> 16:00.110
It was because I knew she killed

16:00.700 --> 16:03.050
the late Empress.

16:03.650 --> 16:05.770
Why only present

16:06.130 --> 16:07.750
the confession now?

16:07.770 --> 16:09.720
The document won't change on its own,

16:10.460 --> 16:11.950
but people may change it.

16:12.060 --> 16:13.890
I fear that Ms. Xu
might retract her statement

16:13.890 --> 16:15.390
and turn against us.

16:15.410 --> 16:17.530
Even if I'm not the smartest,

16:17.770 --> 16:19.560
after being set up so many times,

16:21.410 --> 16:23.260
I should have learned to think.

16:24.130 --> 16:26.260
Alright, get up.

16:29.290 --> 16:30.800
You've always been overbearing.

16:30.820 --> 16:32.390
Who would dare to set you up?

16:32.410 --> 16:33.680
You know very well

16:33.700 --> 16:34.920
who is

16:34.940 --> 16:36.300
the overbearing one

16:36.620 --> 16:37.980
in the harem,

16:38.220 --> 16:39.600
no, in Ling'an

16:39.620 --> 16:41.720
and the entire Dazhou.

16:41.740 --> 16:43.800
It's your sister, Rongyang.

16:43.820 --> 16:45.530
She thinks because she saved your life,

16:45.550 --> 16:47.870
she can do whatever she wants
and trample on human lives.

16:47.890 --> 16:48.920
Enough!

16:48.940 --> 16:50.510
If you speak recklessly again,

16:50.530 --> 16:51.720
you'll be confined

16:51.740 --> 16:53.620
in Jinhua Hall for a month.

16:56.580 --> 16:58.170
Is a month enough?

16:59.410 --> 17:00.970
How about making it longer?

17:04.620 --> 17:06.480
You can just lock up my son and I

17:07.100 --> 17:08.650
for a lifetime.

17:10.370 --> 17:11.730
Nonsense.

17:18.690 --> 17:20.050
Your Highness.

17:22.080 --> 17:23.920
(Blessings and Clarity)
If this is exposed,

17:23.930 --> 17:25.170
it will put Mother and I

17:25.170 --> 17:26.650
in danger.

17:27.020 --> 17:28.110
But now,

17:28.130 --> 17:30.350
Si has been thrown into prison
because of this,

17:30.370 --> 17:32.000
so I'm not sure

17:32.020 --> 17:32.930
if I should continue

17:32.930 --> 17:34.820
to keep this secret.

17:34.890 --> 17:36.380
In my opinion,

17:36.930 --> 17:37.890
you hid the cause

17:37.890 --> 17:39.080
of the blindness earlier

17:39.100 --> 17:40.820
to protect the Empress.

17:41.020 --> 17:43.240
Later, you hid the cure

17:43.260 --> 17:45.080
to protect Prince and Princess Yan.

17:45.100 --> 17:46.970
But all you've done has played

17:47.340 --> 17:49.400
right into the Grand Princess's hands.

17:49.450 --> 17:50.480
So, Mr. Zhen,

17:50.500 --> 17:51.670
what should I do?

17:51.690 --> 17:52.710
Speak out.

17:52.730 --> 17:54.150
Facts speak louder than anything.

17:54.170 --> 17:56.100
Tell His Majesty everything.

17:56.780 --> 17:58.600
Will that really help?

17:58.620 --> 17:59.980
Some things

18:00.170 --> 18:02.330
cannot be kept hidden.

18:02.350 --> 18:04.340
They'll come to light sooner or later.

18:04.650 --> 18:05.810
Your Highness,

18:05.830 --> 18:06.890
if you need some courage,

18:06.890 --> 18:09.370
(Blessings and Clarity)

18:09.370 --> 18:12.060
I can go with you.

18:12.650 --> 18:14.010
Mr. Zhen,

18:14.370 --> 18:15.870
I have a question

18:15.890 --> 18:17.410
for you.

18:18.170 --> 18:19.560
What is it?

18:19.580 --> 18:21.540
Why did you refuse

18:21.540 --> 18:23.210
to marry me that day?

18:25.860 --> 18:27.220
This...

18:30.970 --> 18:31.840
Your Highness,

18:31.860 --> 18:34.540
have some lotus seed tea to cool down.

18:34.890 --> 18:37.540
I've been schemed against by an outsider

18:38.620 --> 18:40.890
for all these years,

18:43.060 --> 18:45.300
and I haven't won once.

18:45.730 --> 18:47.390
I originally thought

18:47.410 --> 18:49.620
Jiang Si was a woman with spirit,

18:51.820 --> 18:53.210
but in the end,

18:53.890 --> 18:55.970
I overestimated myself.

18:56.340 --> 18:58.110
Mother, haven't I warned you

18:58.130 --> 19:00.120
not to give that confession to Father?

19:00.210 --> 19:02.410
What you did won't help Jin

19:02.580 --> 19:04.750
but only harm us.

19:07.690 --> 19:09.090
How rebellious.

19:09.100 --> 19:10.720
How dare you blame me?

19:10.730 --> 19:11.980
Do you think I don't know

19:12.000 --> 19:13.500
the first one to report Jin and Si

19:13.500 --> 19:14.800
was you?

19:14.820 --> 19:15.800
Zhang,

19:15.820 --> 19:17.890
how can you team up
with the Grand Princess

19:17.890 --> 19:20.600
to harm your family?

19:20.620 --> 19:22.840
Jin was enchanted by a witch.

19:22.860 --> 19:24.850
I was trying to eliminate
the threat to Dazhou.

19:24.870 --> 19:25.820
What's wrong with that?

19:25.820 --> 19:28.140
That's your real brother!

19:29.100 --> 19:30.170
If something

19:30.170 --> 19:31.860
happens to him,

19:34.830 --> 19:36.070
I won't have a son who betrayed

19:36.070 --> 19:38.200
his family like you.

19:38.730 --> 19:39.970
Mother, you admit

19:39.970 --> 19:41.780
he's my real brother now?

19:42.340 --> 19:44.450
Are you going to abandon me

19:44.970 --> 19:46.410
for his sake?

19:46.580 --> 19:47.710
In the past,

19:47.730 --> 19:49.930
everyone said Jin was an ill-fated man.

19:50.450 --> 19:52.540
I had no choice.

19:52.690 --> 19:53.760
But now,

19:53.780 --> 19:54.650
we can prove

19:54.650 --> 19:56.190
his innocence.

19:56.210 --> 19:58.450
Why can't you stand united?

19:59.060 --> 20:00.520
As long as one

20:00.540 --> 20:01.650
of you two

20:01.650 --> 20:02.910
can rise to power,

20:02.930 --> 20:04.100
our future

20:04.100 --> 20:06.140
will be secure.

20:06.820 --> 20:08.180
Zhang,

20:08.820 --> 20:10.450
do you understand?

20:11.210 --> 20:12.570
Yes.

20:14.970 --> 20:16.860
You care

20:17.580 --> 20:19.780
about neither of us.

20:20.300 --> 20:22.020
You only care which one of us

20:22.370 --> 20:24.890
can help you become the Empress Dowager.

21:00.800 --> 21:02.840
(Ms. Duo from Changle Palace)

21:02.860 --> 21:06.410
Dozens of Nanwu spies hid in the harem?

21:08.930 --> 21:10.270
Even the Empress's personal maid,

21:10.270 --> 21:11.630
Ms. Duo, is one of them.

21:11.650 --> 21:13.670
Your Majesty, please let me

21:13.690 --> 21:15.020
apprehend all the spies

21:15.020 --> 21:16.350
on this list.

21:16.370 --> 21:18.760
If they're from Nanwu,

21:18.780 --> 21:20.040
we can be sure

21:20.060 --> 21:22.320
that Princess Yan committed treason.

21:22.340 --> 21:25.690
She should be executed,
with her entire clan eradicated.

21:27.180 --> 21:28.040
Arrest them.

21:28.060 --> 21:29.860
Yes, Your Majesty.

21:31.060 --> 21:33.340
Mr. Zhen, why do you remain silent?

21:34.370 --> 21:35.480
Your Majesty,

21:35.500 --> 21:36.760
I also

21:36.780 --> 21:38.340
have something to present.

21:42.780 --> 21:45.100
This is a torn fragment

21:45.450 --> 21:46.950
from the very list in your hand.

21:46.970 --> 21:48.320
I've checked

21:48.340 --> 21:49.670
that this paper

21:49.690 --> 21:51.280
is no ordinary paper

21:51.300 --> 21:53.690
but the rare and highly valuable

21:53.930 --> 21:55.560
Chengxintang Paper.

21:55.580 --> 21:57.970
Chengxintang Paper is worth a fortune.

21:57.970 --> 21:59.910
Even I am reluctant to use it lightly.

21:59.930 --> 22:01.600
Have you ever given

22:01.620 --> 22:03.100
such paper to anyone?

22:03.170 --> 22:05.200
Mr. Zhen, the evidence is clear.

22:05.200 --> 22:06.670
His Majesty has ordered the arrests,

22:06.690 --> 22:08.040
yet you keep evading the topic.

22:08.060 --> 22:09.550
What is your intention?

22:09.690 --> 22:10.870
Go on.

22:10.890 --> 22:12.110
I believe

22:12.130 --> 22:14.390
this list is a fabrication.

22:14.410 --> 22:16.190
If all the maids on it

22:16.210 --> 22:17.670
are truly Nanwu spies,

22:17.690 --> 22:20.380
then the traitor working with Nanwu

22:20.690 --> 22:22.000
might be someone else.

22:22.020 --> 22:23.520
Everyone I questioned

22:23.540 --> 22:24.850
has spoken in Jiang Si's defense.

22:24.860 --> 22:27.580
Even the always
just and impartial Mr. Zhen

22:27.580 --> 22:28.520
holds the same view.

22:28.540 --> 22:29.500
That is enough to prove

22:29.500 --> 22:31.910
that witch has bewitched them all.

22:31.930 --> 22:33.290
Marquis,

22:34.260 --> 22:35.620
may I ask

22:35.690 --> 22:37.650
if you have any solid evidence?

22:37.890 --> 22:39.250
I...

22:39.730 --> 22:41.500
Your Majesty, when I first heard

22:41.500 --> 22:43.320
that Princess Yan was the Saintess,

22:43.340 --> 22:44.520
I also found it

22:44.540 --> 22:46.710
utterly absurd and difficult to accept.

22:46.730 --> 22:49.180
But upon further reflection,

22:49.200 --> 22:50.300
I wonder if there is any law

22:50.300 --> 22:51.800
that convicts a person

22:51.820 --> 22:53.630
based solely on their identity.

22:53.650 --> 22:55.230
The law wants people to be upright.

22:55.250 --> 22:57.640
Is that not the very foundation
of the laws you established?

22:57.650 --> 22:59.080
Jiang Si hasn't broken any law

22:59.080 --> 22:59.960
or committed treason.

22:59.980 --> 23:01.320
Though she's Nanwu's Saintess,

23:01.340 --> 23:02.890
I believe

23:03.000 --> 23:04.930
- she is innocent.
- If she's declared innocent,

23:04.930 --> 23:06.670
how will the officials

23:06.690 --> 23:07.760
accept it?

23:07.780 --> 23:10.870
Are you thinking only of Prince Yan

23:10.890 --> 23:13.250
and not of His Majesty?

23:27.300 --> 23:29.170
The Saintess's identity is exposed,

23:29.410 --> 23:31.370
and Emperor Jingming has imprisoned her.

23:31.390 --> 23:32.840
She could be executed at any time.

23:32.860 --> 23:35.140
That day, we should've taken her away,

23:35.170 --> 23:36.930
so things wouldn't be like this.

23:37.450 --> 23:38.600
Save the Saintess first.

23:38.620 --> 23:39.600
Will the spies

23:39.620 --> 23:41.080
in the Palace be useful?

23:43.690 --> 23:44.870
This is the important item

23:44.890 --> 23:46.300
I returned to retrieve.

23:47.500 --> 23:49.000
A map of the secret passages.

23:49.020 --> 23:51.430
Over the years I've been lurking
in the Palace,

23:51.450 --> 23:53.390
besides passing intel
to the Grand Elder,

23:53.410 --> 23:55.110
I also found a hidden passage.

23:55.130 --> 23:56.350
It was built

23:56.370 --> 23:57.690
by Emperor Jingming

23:57.690 --> 23:59.000
after Prince Xiang's rebellion.

23:59.020 --> 24:00.060
The tunnels are intricate

24:00.060 --> 24:01.040
and maze-like.

24:01.060 --> 24:01.750
A single misstep

24:01.770 --> 24:03.510
can cause the intruder
to be lost forever.

24:03.510 --> 24:04.870
That cunning old fox

24:04.890 --> 24:06.340
truly is devious.

24:07.910 --> 24:09.840
- Keep it.
- But even with this,

24:09.860 --> 24:11.450
it's still not enough.

24:11.580 --> 24:12.940
Prince Yan.

24:13.930 --> 24:15.080
Why are you here?

24:15.100 --> 24:16.460
I followed you.

24:16.930 --> 24:18.700
The prison is heavily guarded.

24:18.720 --> 24:20.560
Even if you manage
to sneak into the Palace

24:20.580 --> 24:22.560
through the secret passage,

24:22.580 --> 24:24.280
getting into the prison is impossible.

24:24.300 --> 24:25.320
Ignore him.

24:25.340 --> 24:26.840
He is a Prince of Dazhou.

24:26.860 --> 24:29.100
Even if his wife is imprisoned,

24:29.170 --> 24:30.860
he would never help us.

24:30.860 --> 24:31.860
It is because my wife

24:31.860 --> 24:33.560
has been thrown into prison

24:33.580 --> 24:36.340
that I must cooperate with you.

24:41.760 --> 24:45.280
(Grand Princess's Mansion)

24:48.820 --> 24:50.450
His Majesty

24:50.650 --> 24:53.320
will believe Zhen Heng

24:53.340 --> 24:55.320
and declare them innocent?

24:55.340 --> 24:57.250
There is no final verdict yet.

24:57.650 --> 24:58.950
But in my opinion,

24:58.970 --> 25:02.210
His Majesty has wavered.

25:02.260 --> 25:03.620
At the very least,

25:03.730 --> 25:05.430
the death sentence can be avoided.

25:05.450 --> 25:08.020
Since His Majesty is soft,

25:08.540 --> 25:10.730
then let me handle it.

25:11.580 --> 25:14.450
(It seems I must rescue
the Saintess asap.)

25:15.690 --> 25:17.050
Shijiu,

25:17.170 --> 25:19.020
send a message to Han Ran.

25:19.170 --> 25:20.630
At the Mao hour tomorrow,

25:20.650 --> 25:22.800
secretly open the Palace's side gate.

25:22.820 --> 25:24.180
Marquis.

25:24.260 --> 25:25.320
Your Highness.

25:25.340 --> 25:28.820
Please rid Dazhou of evil.

25:33.450 --> 25:36.690
You act solely
for the good of the nation.

25:36.820 --> 25:39.930
I vow to follow you unto death.

25:48.100 --> 25:49.000
Uncle.

25:49.020 --> 25:49.870
Long Dan.

25:49.890 --> 25:50.970
Have you found out

25:50.970 --> 25:52.280
anything about Si?

25:52.300 --> 25:54.320
Miss Jiang Si has been imprisoned.

25:54.340 --> 25:55.690
Was it the Grand Princess

25:55.690 --> 25:57.590
who accused her before His Majesty?

25:59.260 --> 26:00.930
I knew it.

26:02.300 --> 26:04.410
Si was right.

26:04.500 --> 26:06.890
No matter how much we retreat,

26:06.890 --> 26:09.250
she will never let us go.

26:09.500 --> 26:10.860
Long Dan,

26:11.170 --> 26:14.000
can you take me out of here?

26:14.020 --> 26:15.380
Ancheng,

26:15.860 --> 26:17.300
where are you going?

26:18.020 --> 26:20.020
To save my daughter.

26:20.690 --> 26:22.050
To submit

26:22.490 --> 26:23.410
a memorial

26:23.410 --> 26:26.170
that was delayed for 20 years.

26:28.060 --> 26:29.420
Mother,

26:30.170 --> 26:31.890
do you want to stop me

26:32.730 --> 26:35.060
at this point?

26:58.100 --> 26:59.350
Stop!

26:59.370 --> 27:00.730
Who are you?

27:10.910 --> 27:13.800
I'm Jiang Ancheng, a former official
of the Astronomy, Earl Dongping.

27:13.820 --> 27:17.730
I have something to say.

27:17.730 --> 27:19.300
(Jiang Ancheng, Earl Dongping)

27:19.300 --> 27:23.190
On the 5 day of the 5th month
of the 3rd year of Jingming,

27:23.210 --> 27:26.840
the Northern Star shone bright,

27:26.860 --> 27:29.210
an auspicious omen.

27:29.340 --> 27:33.240
That night, the 7th Prince was born.

27:33.260 --> 27:36.930
It was a sign of harmony
between heaven and man.

27:36.970 --> 27:39.040
I humbly request His Majesty's attention

27:39.060 --> 27:43.380
so that heaven's favor may bless Dazhou
with an enduring reign.

27:43.860 --> 27:44.840
Report this at once!

27:44.860 --> 27:46.910
(Zhuque Gate)
I'm Jiang Ancheng, a former official

27:46.930 --> 27:51.730
of the Astronomy, Earl Dongping.
I have something to say.

27:56.200 --> 27:57.080
An order from above:

27:57.100 --> 27:58.910
The Nanwu witch is
to be interrogated alone.

27:58.930 --> 28:00.290
- Yes.
- Yes.

28:05.340 --> 28:06.700
Move!

28:36.060 --> 28:37.390
Jiang Si,

28:37.410 --> 28:39.250
why are you not surprised

28:39.300 --> 28:40.950
to see me?

28:40.970 --> 28:42.020
Your tactics are nothing

28:42.020 --> 28:44.020
more than petty tricks.

28:45.130 --> 28:47.000
What's there to be surprised about?

28:47.020 --> 28:48.410
Then

28:49.260 --> 28:50.890
what about Jiang Ancheng?

28:50.930 --> 28:52.240
Your father

28:52.260 --> 28:55.020
cares deeply for you.

28:55.970 --> 28:57.520
He actually dared

28:57.540 --> 29:00.320
to kneel outside the Palace

29:00.340 --> 29:02.380
and accuse me.

29:03.370 --> 29:04.730
What?

29:05.070 --> 29:07.540
I humbly request His Majesty's attention

29:07.730 --> 29:12.540
so that heaven's favor may bless Dazhou
with an enduring reign.

29:13.300 --> 29:15.560
He must not be allowed
to see His Majesty.

29:15.580 --> 29:17.580
And I must never

29:18.260 --> 29:19.600
see him again.

29:19.620 --> 29:20.490
Yes.

29:20.500 --> 29:21.670
Don't hurt my father!

29:21.690 --> 29:22.950
Don't hurt my father!

29:22.970 --> 29:24.390
You can do whatever you want to me.

29:24.410 --> 29:25.580
I will agree to any terms.

29:25.580 --> 29:27.280
Just don't harm my father!

29:27.300 --> 29:28.430
Please.

29:28.450 --> 29:30.490
I beg you! Don't hurt my father!

29:31.340 --> 29:35.820
The Northern Star shone bright,

29:35.890 --> 29:38.480
an auspicious omen.

29:38.500 --> 29:39.690
I will agree to any terms.

29:39.690 --> 29:41.450
Just don't harm my father!

29:50.300 --> 29:52.040
You wretched woman!

29:52.060 --> 29:53.130
You have no right

29:53.130 --> 29:55.210
to bargain with me.

29:57.170 --> 30:00.210
Father, why are you here?

30:00.260 --> 30:01.620
Your Highness,

30:01.890 --> 30:04.040
Si is imprisoned.

30:04.060 --> 30:05.450
The only way to save her

30:05.450 --> 30:07.430
is to bring down the Grand Princess.

30:07.450 --> 30:08.840
I must submit a memorial

30:08.860 --> 30:10.240
to inform His Majesty

30:10.260 --> 30:12.370
of how the Grand Princess
falsified celestial omens

30:12.370 --> 30:14.150
and framed you.

30:14.170 --> 30:15.950
Should we not plan this carefully?

30:15.970 --> 30:18.340
No need to dissuade me any longer.

30:18.780 --> 30:20.000
I've always

30:20.020 --> 30:22.380
been weak.

30:22.500 --> 30:24.370
Si has suffered so much

30:24.370 --> 30:26.350
because of my cowardice.

30:26.370 --> 30:28.190
How can I sit idly by any longer

30:28.340 --> 30:31.210
with the current situation?

30:34.060 --> 30:35.420
Very well.

30:35.860 --> 30:37.060
I'll take you to the Palace.

30:37.080 --> 30:38.970
(Tiande Hall)

30:38.970 --> 30:40.630
Your Majesty,

30:40.650 --> 30:41.810
the Grand Princess

30:41.820 --> 30:43.840
altered celestial omens

30:43.860 --> 30:46.870
to frame the 7th Prince
as an ill-omened child.

30:46.890 --> 30:50.110
She did this to divert blame
from General Cui's defeat,

30:50.130 --> 30:52.760
as well as to stop Consort Xian
from being promoted

30:52.780 --> 30:55.190
(Memorial from the Astronomy)
because of the 7th Prince.

30:55.210 --> 30:56.840
She bribed the Astronomy

30:56.860 --> 30:58.340
to alter the auspicious sign

30:58.340 --> 30:59.650
on the 7th Prince's birth record.

30:59.660 --> 31:01.500
With this, the blame
for the military failure

31:01.500 --> 31:04.110
was shifted onto the newborn Prince.

31:04.110 --> 31:05.570
She killed two birds with one stone.

31:05.580 --> 31:07.710
Not only did it stop
Consort Xian's promotion,

31:07.730 --> 31:08.930
but it protected General Cui

31:08.930 --> 31:11.840
from the wrath
of the court and the people.

31:11.860 --> 31:13.630
These are baseless accusations.

31:13.650 --> 31:15.840
They are not.

31:15.860 --> 31:17.340
I overheard their conversation

31:17.340 --> 31:18.480
back then.

31:18.500 --> 31:21.520
But to protect myself,

31:21.540 --> 31:24.280
(An auspicious omen)
I remained silent.

31:24.300 --> 31:26.020
But I refused to sink

31:26.020 --> 31:27.280
to such depths,

31:27.300 --> 31:30.580
so I chose to resign and return home.

31:31.210 --> 31:32.280
Jin.

31:32.300 --> 31:33.280
Here.

31:33.300 --> 31:34.950
Do you know about this?

31:34.970 --> 31:36.330
Yes.

31:39.690 --> 31:42.630
I should place this branding iron

31:42.650 --> 31:44.540
on your mouth

31:45.450 --> 31:48.060
and burn your tongue with it.

31:49.410 --> 31:51.970
That'd be the best.

31:53.930 --> 31:55.340
Please...

31:55.650 --> 31:56.870
I beg you.

31:56.890 --> 31:58.860
Please spare my father.

32:01.020 --> 32:02.260
What about Mingyue?

32:02.260 --> 32:03.890
What about my daughter?

32:14.650 --> 32:15.870
Father.

32:15.890 --> 32:18.560
I do indeed feel wronged,

32:18.580 --> 32:20.110
but I do not harbor resentment,

32:20.130 --> 32:21.600
for I know that you

32:21.620 --> 32:23.540
have also been deceived.

32:26.170 --> 32:28.490
Very well, I understand.

32:28.860 --> 32:30.040
You may all leave.

32:30.060 --> 32:30.900
Your Majesty...

32:30.910 --> 32:33.140
Yes, Your Majesty.

32:39.860 --> 32:42.040
That's it?

32:42.060 --> 32:44.280
What exactly does His Majesty intend?

32:44.300 --> 32:45.970
To bring down the Grand Princess,

32:45.970 --> 32:47.320
your words alone

32:47.340 --> 32:48.700
are far from enough.

32:49.170 --> 32:50.530
So...

32:56.210 --> 32:58.110
Your Highness, the Emperor

32:58.130 --> 32:59.580
urgently summons you.

33:09.260 --> 33:10.620
Sorry for my failure.

33:10.690 --> 33:12.110
Yu Jin protected Jiang Ancheng

33:12.130 --> 33:14.130
and brought Ms. Duo into the Palace.

33:16.300 --> 33:17.660
Go.

33:18.170 --> 33:20.320
- Inform Marquis Changxing.
- Yes.

33:20.340 --> 33:22.540
Thank you for bringing me
into the Palace.

33:22.650 --> 33:25.300
Do you know you might die this time?

33:25.410 --> 33:27.000
As long as the Saintess is unharmed,

33:27.020 --> 33:28.580
my death will be worth it.

33:31.820 --> 33:33.320
I'll leave the Saintess to you.

33:33.340 --> 33:34.700
Rest assured.

33:35.410 --> 33:37.620
Ms. Duo, come with me.

33:53.760 --> 33:55.760
(Imperial Prison)

33:58.500 --> 34:01.540
Summon Princess Fuqing in.

34:06.620 --> 34:08.170
Greetings, Father.

34:08.900 --> 34:10.360
Today, I've brought someone

34:10.380 --> 34:12.100
for you to meet.

34:13.330 --> 34:14.690
Who?

34:23.380 --> 34:24.730
Ms. Duo has an important matter

34:24.730 --> 34:26.370
to report to you.

34:26.580 --> 34:27.420
Let her go.

34:27.420 --> 34:28.780
- Yes.
- Yes.

34:29.650 --> 34:31.460
What is it? Tell me.

34:31.540 --> 34:32.520
Your Majesty,

34:32.540 --> 34:34.650
Jiang Si is the Saintess of Nanwu,

34:34.730 --> 34:36.130
but she has never had

34:36.130 --> 34:37.730
any connection with us.

34:37.850 --> 34:40.190
The true traitor is someone else.

34:40.210 --> 34:42.140
It is your most beloved sister,

34:42.620 --> 34:43.980
Rongyang.

34:44.580 --> 34:45.670
Rongyang?

34:45.690 --> 34:47.290
I have evidence to present.

34:51.690 --> 34:53.540
This is the Slumber Flower,

34:53.540 --> 34:54.400
unique to Nanwu.

34:54.420 --> 34:55.620
With its pollen in water,

34:55.620 --> 34:56.910
it'll be colorless and tasteless

34:56.930 --> 34:57.920
but highly poisonous.

34:57.940 --> 35:00.100
The Grand Princess once ordered someone

35:00.580 --> 35:03.040
to use this to kill Su Ke,
Earl Dongping's wife,

35:03.060 --> 35:05.060
the mother of Princess Yan.

35:05.100 --> 35:06.420
Afterward, she ordered me

35:06.420 --> 35:08.620
to blind Princess Fuqing

35:09.210 --> 35:11.170
and lurk by Empress Di's side.

35:11.420 --> 35:13.330
You're a spy from Nanwu.

35:13.690 --> 35:14.890
Do you think I'll believe you

35:14.890 --> 35:16.560
after just a few words?

35:16.580 --> 35:17.520
Father,

35:17.540 --> 35:19.530
everything Ms. Duo said is true.

35:19.550 --> 35:20.530
When I was accidentally

35:20.540 --> 35:22.110
locked in a cupboard back then,

35:22.130 --> 35:23.100
I overheard

35:23.100 --> 35:24.560
Aunt and Ms. Duo

35:24.580 --> 35:26.630
discussing a plot
to kill the late Empress.

35:26.650 --> 35:27.750
After this,

35:27.770 --> 35:29.980
I lost my eyesight,

35:30.290 --> 35:31.480
and then Ms. Duo

35:31.500 --> 35:33.400
appeared beside me.

35:33.420 --> 35:34.480
Are you saying

35:34.500 --> 35:36.210
Rongyang planted Ms. Duo beside you

35:36.210 --> 35:38.520
to keep an eye on you?

35:38.540 --> 35:39.790
Yes.

35:39.810 --> 35:42.360
I was too fearful back then

35:42.380 --> 35:45.100
to reveal this for the sake

35:45.170 --> 35:47.140
of Mother and I.

35:47.210 --> 35:47.850
But now,

35:47.870 --> 35:49.040
Jiang Si, who once helped me,

35:49.060 --> 35:50.560
has been framed by the Grand Princess

35:50.580 --> 35:51.750
and thrown into prison.

35:51.770 --> 35:53.850
So today, I wish to plead with you

35:53.860 --> 35:55.270
to investigate the Grand Princess

35:55.290 --> 35:56.980
and clear Jiang Si's name.

35:58.690 --> 36:00.050
Ms. Duo,

36:00.460 --> 36:01.820
do you realize

36:01.900 --> 36:02.940
that by admitting to being

36:02.940 --> 36:04.520
a Nanwu spy today,

36:04.540 --> 36:05.920
you will never be able

36:05.940 --> 36:07.900
to leave the Palace again?

36:08.020 --> 36:09.660
I chose to enter the Palace.

36:10.540 --> 36:12.580
I know what the outcome will be.

36:12.650 --> 36:14.580
My death will be worth it,

36:15.770 --> 36:17.400
if you, as the Emperor of Dazhou,

36:17.420 --> 36:19.020
can tell right from wrong.

36:38.500 --> 36:39.860
Saintess.

36:55.500 --> 36:56.790
Your Majesty,

36:56.810 --> 36:58.270
why summon me so urgently?

36:58.290 --> 36:59.650
Rongyang,

37:01.020 --> 37:03.260
do you know

37:03.330 --> 37:05.540
Ms. Duo's true identity?

37:08.580 --> 37:10.370
She is a Nanwu spy.

37:11.210 --> 37:13.250
Today, she came

37:13.330 --> 37:16.500
to accuse you of your crimes.

37:17.290 --> 37:18.650
How interesting.

37:18.690 --> 37:20.810
Your Majesty, please tell me more.

37:21.020 --> 37:21.960
She said

37:21.980 --> 37:23.540
you ordered her

37:23.690 --> 37:25.400
to kill the late Empress.

37:25.420 --> 37:27.480
The Grand Princess then worked with me

37:27.500 --> 37:29.700
and promised to help me
enter the Palace,

37:30.210 --> 37:31.460
but I had to help her kill

37:31.460 --> 37:33.100
the Empress of Dazhou.

37:33.420 --> 37:35.580
I killed the late Empress?

37:36.210 --> 37:38.580
How could I conspire with Nanwu

37:38.770 --> 37:40.980
to harm our late Empress?

37:42.940 --> 37:44.300
She also said...

37:44.330 --> 37:46.040
The Grand Princess once ordered someone

37:46.060 --> 37:48.560
to use this to kill Su Ke,
Earl Dongping's wife,

37:49.500 --> 37:51.500
the mother of Princess Yan.

37:51.730 --> 37:53.650
Are you saying

37:53.690 --> 37:57.230
that Su Ke's death
is also related to me?

37:57.250 --> 37:59.370
Haven't you always resented her?

37:59.770 --> 38:01.130
Isn't that so?

38:04.770 --> 38:06.290
Your Majesty,

38:06.580 --> 38:10.040
Su Ke's death has nothing to do with me.

38:10.060 --> 38:13.110
So, Fuqing's blindness years ago

38:13.130 --> 38:14.680
also has nothing to do with you, right?

38:14.690 --> 38:16.170
This is the very Nanwu worm

38:16.170 --> 38:18.080
that caused Princess Fuqing's

38:18.100 --> 38:19.360
blindness.

38:19.380 --> 38:20.740
Of course.

38:21.210 --> 38:23.460
You know me the best.

38:23.900 --> 38:25.080
You must not be deceived

38:25.100 --> 38:27.080
by those crafty Nanwu people.

38:27.100 --> 38:28.830
Ms. Duo and Jiang Si

38:28.850 --> 38:30.960
must've colluded together,

38:30.980 --> 38:33.730
using any means to falsely accuse me.

38:33.940 --> 38:35.300
So,

38:35.690 --> 38:37.600
you didn't sell

38:37.620 --> 38:39.400
Dazhou's war horses to Nanwu,

38:39.420 --> 38:40.600
right?

38:40.620 --> 38:41.500
For more money,

38:41.500 --> 38:43.110
the Grand Princess

38:43.130 --> 38:44.800
sold Dazhou's war horses to Nanwu.

38:44.800 --> 38:45.640
(Ledger)

38:45.640 --> 38:47.790
This ledger contains
the transaction details.

38:47.810 --> 38:48.960
Impossible.

38:48.980 --> 38:50.340
Very well.

38:50.940 --> 38:52.300
I believe you.

38:52.380 --> 38:54.370
I also think it is impossible.

38:54.500 --> 38:56.580
Baoping, prepare the tea.

38:58.500 --> 38:59.400
Rongyang,

38:59.420 --> 39:00.920
you've come under the scorching sun.

39:00.940 --> 39:02.520
You must be thirsty.

39:02.540 --> 39:04.880
I've heard that tea made
with this flower

39:04.900 --> 39:06.370
is the sweetest.

39:06.730 --> 39:08.540
Try it for me.

39:20.330 --> 39:21.870
Why aren't you drinking?

39:24.650 --> 39:26.010
Your Majesty,

39:26.980 --> 39:28.670
what do you mean by this?

39:28.690 --> 39:30.350
This is the Slumber Flower,

39:30.810 --> 39:33.110
unique to Nanwu.

39:33.130 --> 39:34.150
With its pollen in water,

39:34.150 --> 39:35.400
it'll be colorless and tasteless

39:35.420 --> 39:36.480
but highly poisonous.

39:36.500 --> 39:38.540
The one in your hand

39:39.380 --> 39:41.080
came from the Grand Princess's yard.

39:41.100 --> 39:42.770
So, Your Majesty

39:43.500 --> 39:44.900
has been waiting for me here.

39:44.900 --> 39:46.670
When you were colluding with Nanwu,

39:46.690 --> 39:47.680
did you ever consider me

39:47.690 --> 39:48.960
your brother?

39:48.980 --> 39:50.250
Didn't you also cause the death

39:50.250 --> 39:51.920
of my only daughter?

39:51.940 --> 39:54.170
I never imagined

39:54.170 --> 39:55.460
you'd commit such a monstrous,

39:55.460 --> 39:57.330
unforgivable act.

39:58.330 --> 40:00.000
Do you have any final words?

40:00.100 --> 40:02.370
Your Majesty,

40:03.100 --> 40:05.210
the world has changed.

40:06.060 --> 40:08.020
I don't need to drink

40:08.730 --> 40:11.330
the poisoned tea.

40:27.500 --> 40:28.860
Rongyang,

40:29.420 --> 40:30.780
I never expected

40:31.060 --> 40:33.580
that one day you would rebel.

40:33.690 --> 40:35.210
I'm not rebelling.

40:35.690 --> 40:37.420
I'm just protecting myself.

40:37.900 --> 40:39.330
It was you

40:39.810 --> 40:41.360
who pushed me

40:41.380 --> 40:43.100
step by step to this point.

40:43.290 --> 40:44.280
Over the years,

40:44.300 --> 40:46.770
I've been exceedingly favored you.

40:47.330 --> 40:48.920
What exactly do you want?

40:48.940 --> 40:50.540
What do I want?

40:53.730 --> 40:55.190
I want my daughter

40:55.210 --> 40:56.810
to live safely,

40:58.330 --> 41:00.980
my husband to love me,

41:01.580 --> 41:03.370
and my brother

41:04.060 --> 41:05.650
to never abandon me,

41:05.980 --> 41:08.020
no matter what.

41:09.210 --> 41:10.570
Your Majesty,

41:10.850 --> 41:12.290
am I too greedy?

41:12.380 --> 41:14.500
Which of my wishes can you fulfill?

41:14.690 --> 41:17.600
I granted your marriage

41:17.620 --> 41:20.110
to Cui Xu

41:20.130 --> 41:20.980
and Mingyue's marriage

41:20.980 --> 41:22.560
to Jin.

41:22.580 --> 41:24.730
I've fulfilled all your wishes

41:24.980 --> 41:28.040
and made you
the noblest Princess of Dazhou,

41:28.060 --> 41:30.580
but in the end, you resent me.

41:30.900 --> 41:32.670
What exactly do you want me to do?

41:32.690 --> 41:34.880
I want you to kill Jiang Si.

41:34.900 --> 41:37.020
She is the Saintess of Nanwu.

41:37.330 --> 41:38.770
Yet you didn't kill her,

41:39.060 --> 41:41.020
but try to poison me in turn.

41:41.330 --> 41:42.520
Why?

41:42.540 --> 41:43.340
Why is that?

41:43.360 --> 41:44.330
That is a public affair;

41:44.330 --> 41:45.980
you are my family.

41:55.580 --> 41:59.900
Well said.

42:00.730 --> 42:02.090
Your Majesty,

42:04.130 --> 42:06.810
since you cannot avenge Mingyue,

42:07.730 --> 42:09.370
then let me

42:10.380 --> 42:13.100
avenge her death.

42:13.620 --> 42:15.690
Jiang Si and Yu Jin

42:16.620 --> 42:18.210
will die a horrible death.

42:20.250 --> 42:22.000
I also want you to experience

42:22.020 --> 42:23.710
the feeling of being forsaken

42:23.730 --> 42:25.710
and losing a beloved child.

42:25.730 --> 42:27.080
They must all die.

42:27.100 --> 42:29.210
They must all die with my daughter.

42:32.290 --> 42:34.540
Are you still the same Rongyang?

42:34.620 --> 42:36.600
What have you changed into?

42:36.620 --> 42:38.540
I barely recognize you anymore.

42:38.650 --> 42:40.290
I haven't changed.

42:42.130 --> 42:43.680
It's you who has changed.

42:44.060 --> 42:46.440
My brother has never hurt me

42:46.460 --> 42:48.580
and would never poison me.

42:49.020 --> 42:50.850
From the moment you handed me

42:50.850 --> 42:52.500
that cup of poisoned tea,

42:52.770 --> 42:55.330
I no longer have a brother.

42:56.940 --> 42:59.170
I truly regret it.

42:59.580 --> 43:00.920
Regret what?

43:00.940 --> 43:03.240
Regret putting you on the throne.

43:03.240 --> 43:07.280
(The End of Episode 37)

43:07.771 --> 43:09.501
♪ From place to place ♪

43:09.501 --> 43:14.441
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

43:14.811 --> 43:17.191
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:17.191 --> 43:21.421
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:22.131 --> 43:24.531
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:24.551 --> 43:28.211
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:28.231 --> 43:31.651
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:31.801 --> 43:37.321
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:38.141 --> 43:41.821
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:41.821 --> 43:45.901
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:46.141 --> 43:47.881
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:47.901 --> 43:52.601
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:52.601 --> 43:56.171
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:56.191 --> 44:00.421
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:00.441 --> 44:02.221
♪ Time glows ♪

44:02.221 --> 44:06.761
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:06.781 --> 44:11.581
♪ And stars ♪

44:15.811 --> 44:18.341
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:18.361 --> 44:21.981
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:22.001 --> 44:25.431
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:25.451 --> 44:30.071
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:30.071 --> 44:33.761
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:33.781 --> 44:37.871
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:37.981 --> 44:39.801
♪ Time glows ♪

44:39.801 --> 44:44.351
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:44.371 --> 44:48.071
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:48.091 --> 44:52.251
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:52.431 --> 44:54.191
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:54.191 --> 44:58.711
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:58.711 --> 45:02.351
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

45:02.371 --> 45:08.041
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

45:09.731 --> 45:11.661
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

45:11.661 --> 45:19.161
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
